Gen 11:1 , One language in the world;
Gen 11:2 , The building of Babel;
Gen 11:5 , It is interrupted by the confusion of tongues, and the builders dispersed;
Gen 11:10 , The generations of Shem;
Gen 11:27 , The generations of Terah, the father of Abram;
Gen 11:31 , Terah, with Abram and Lot, remove from Ur to Haran.
